    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA superb opportunity to acquire a charming 3-bedroom cottage extending to approximately 62m²/670ft², ideally positioned on the edge of Duleek village. Occupying a generous c.0.3-acre site, the property offers considerable potential for those seeking a home with scope to modernise, extend or further develope, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\nThe property enjoys a wonderful rural setting with attractive countryside views, while remaining exceptionally convenient to a host of amenities and transport links. Duleek village is within easy reach (800m), while the M1 motorway, N2 and R132 are all readily accessible, providing excellent connectivity to the surrounding area.\nIts central location between Drogheda and the N2 makes this an attractive proposition for commuters, with the M1 motorway less than 5 minutes away. Dublin Airport and the M50 orbital motorway are both within a 30-minute drive, while Drogheda town centre is just 7.5km away, offering an extensive range of shopping, leisure, educational and recreational facilities.\nCombining the tranquility of a countryside setting with excellent accessibility, this property represents an exciting opportunity to acquire a home on a substantial site in a highly convenient location.\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole agents Sherry FitzGerald Lannon."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.78 x 1.13\n\n\nSitting Room - 3.03 x 4.41\n\n\nKitchen/Dining - 3.62 x 3.64\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.73 x 4.41\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.15 x 2.59\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.06 x 2.59\n\n\nBathroom - 2.43 x 2.41\n\n\nTOTAL: - Approx. 62 SqM/670 SqFt\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Oil central heating</li><li>Solid fuel open fire </li><li>Gated entrance</li><li>Natural stone wall to front site boundary</li><li>0.3 acre site</li><li>800m to centre of Duleek village</li><li>Junction 8 & 9 of M1 motorway both within 4.5km</li><li>6.7km to Drogheda Retail Park</li><li>7.5km to Drogheda</li><li>Easy access to R132 and N2</li><li>Dublin airport within a 30 minute drive</ul>"
      },
